{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13538","headline":"挽歌词 · 赵徵明","name":"挽歌词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒日蒿上明，凄凄郭东路。\n素车谁家子，丹旐引将去。\n原下荆棘丛，丛边有新墓。\n人间痛伤别，此是长别处。\n旷野多萧条，青松白杨树。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵徵明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13538.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13538","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}